        "subject": "\u2705 n8n updated: {{ $('Check Docker Uptime').item.json.previousVersion }} \u2192 {{ $('Check Docker Uptime').item.json.currentVersion }}",
        "bodyContent": "=<h2>n8n was updated</h2><p><strong>Previous version:</strong> {{ $('Check Docker Uptime').item.json.previousVersion }}</p><p><strong>New version:</strong> {{ $('Check Docker Uptime').item.json.currentVersion }}</p><p><strong>Detected at:</strong> {{ $('Check Docker Uptime').item.json.detectedAt }}</p><p>Your workflows are running normally. No action needed.</p><p><a href=\"https://[your-n8n-domain]\">Open n8n</a></p>"
